Error [E0302]: Fact read `@layout` is compile-time only
  --> tests/ui/fact_layout_runtime.jet:7:18
    |
  7 |     size :: Ring.@layout.size
    |                  ^^^^^^^
 Why: A fact is a value known before code generation; it never selects runtime behavior
 Fix: Write `@fact :: Ring.@layout`, then use `@fact` in this expression
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0302
